@startuml
!include ../includes/attestify-theme.puml
!include ../includes/sequence-conventions.puml
title Build Definition Package
actor User
participant "Build adapter" as Adapter
participant "BuildDefinitionPackageUC" as UC
participant "Definition admission" as Admission
participant "attestify-oci build driver" as Driver
User -> Adapter: nape package build
Adapter -> UC: admitted request
UC -> Admission: controlled root + PURL
Admission --> UC: paths + references
UC -> Driver: sealed source + dependencies
Driver --> UC: verified exact build
UC --> Adapter: completed or rejected
@enduml
